{"nodes": [{"id": "skill_deploying", "label": "Skill: deploying (section 16, tasks 16.1-16.3, Vercel)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "frontmatter + full body", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deploy the pipeline before the product: in the reference project deployment came last, the session ran out and the trainer finished it himself."}, {"id": "skill_section_17_tools_review", "label": "Curriculum section 17 - tools table review (day 10, right after deploy)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 9.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_task_16_1_deploy_setup", "label": "Task 16.1 - deploy setup: Vercel MCP + vercel login (day 3, once)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_task_16_2_first_deploy", "label": "Task 16.2 - first live URL (link, root dir, prod env vars, --prod)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_task_16_3_final_redeploy", "label": "Task 16.3 - final redeploy after testing (day 10, minutes)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 6", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "skill_tool_vercel_mcp", "label": "Tool: Vercel MCP (https://mcp.vercel.com - project mgmt, deploy logs)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "sections 1-2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reads deployment logs so failures are diagnosed instead of guessed; Claude Code is an officially supported client."}, {"id": "skill_tool_vercel_cli", "label": "Tool: Vercel CLI (login, link, env add, --prod)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Does the actual deploy and sets env vars, because the MCP has no environment-variable tools yet."}, {"id": "skill_concept_two_deployment_moments", "label": "Two separate deployment moments: day 3 (16.1+16.2) and day 10 (16.3)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 0", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "We deploy the pipeline before the product: in the reference project deployment came last, the session did not finish and the trainer completed it himself, so any breakage on the way would have surfaced at the worst possible time. Never repeat 16.1 on day 10 - it confuses the trainee into thinking something broke."}, {"id": "skill_split_vercel_mcp_vs_cli", "label": "Tool split: Vercel MCP manages and diagnoses, the CLI deploys and sets env vars", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The MCP has no environment-variable tools yet, so the two are used together and neither replaces the other."}, {"id": "skill_rule_root_dir_and_env_before_deploy", "label": "Rule: set the root directory and add production env vars before deploying, not after", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "sections 3 and 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Otherwise the deploy succeeds and the product breaks at runtime. Also confirm .vercel is in .gitignore before any push, and verify the auth check actually passes rather than assuming it."}, {"id": "skill_warning_empty_looking_first_url", "label": "Warning: tell the trainee in advance the first URL will look empty - the outcome is that it opened", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "On day 3 there is a skeleton, not a product, and he does not know that - he may read the near-empty page as a failed deploy."}, {"id": "skill_rule_read_logs_not_guess", "label": "Rule: when a deploy fails, read the log via Vercel MCP and summarise - never guess, never hand over the raw log", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "He reads neither code nor logs - you read, he reads your summary of what failed, why, and what you will do."}, {"id": "skill_warning_update_callback_urls", "label": "Warning: after deploy, update external-service redirect/callback and CORS URLs to production", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 6.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The single most common post-deploy breakage - the service works locally and fails on the live link. Better still, register both the local and the production callback back at task 14.7, since the production URL is known from day 3 and most providers accept several."}, {"id": "skill_rule_verify_on_live_url", "label": "Rule: verify on the production URL itself - 'works on my machine' is not evidence", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 6.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Walk a full journey on the live link including login and any external service, then report the result."}, {"id": "skill_rule_redeploy_is_cheap", "label": "Rule: after the first success every redeploy is just vercel --prod - do not wait for day 10", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 6.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Task 16.3 is the final redeploy, not the only one."}, {"id": "skill_final_tools_table_audit", "label": "Final audit: deployment adds the last tool, so review the whole tools table before the review section", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 9.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compare the table against what was actually used, ask the trainee explicitly about his product's own external services (payment, maps, mail, messaging) since only he knows their purpose in his words, and make sure purposes are written in his language because he presents every line."}, {"id": "skill_deploy_five_obstacles", "label": "Five real deployment obstacles to pre-empt (stalling in the dashboard, auth check failure, missing root dir or keys, stale callback URLs, committed .vercel)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All five actually happened in a real run; lead the steps yourself instead of letting the trainee search the Vercel dashboard."}], "edges": [{"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_task_16_1_deploy_setup", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 2", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_task_16_2_first_deploy", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_task_16_3_final_redeploy", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_section_17_tools_review", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 9.1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_concept_two_deployment_moments", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 0", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_split_vercel_mcp_vs_cli", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_rule_root_dir_and_env_before_deploy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/deploying/SKILL.md", "source_location": "section 3", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "skill_deploying", "target": "skill_wa